<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπροσθ-εν</span></b> , sts. also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπροσθε</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			5.62
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			7.144
		</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
			Isoc.
			<u>Ep.</u>
			4.10
		</span></i>, in Poets metri gr., <i><span class="en">
			Hegesipp.Com.
			1.20
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Nicom.Com.
			1.14
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			A.R.
			4.590
		</span></i>: neither form in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> or Trag., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὔμπροσθεν</span> dub. in
			<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Hipp.</u>
			1228
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			Adv., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of
			Place, <i>before, in front</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.2.23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔ</span>. <i>the front, the
			foreside</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.62
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ ἔ</span>.
				<i>forwards</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.61
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στὰς ἐκ τοῦ ἔ</span>. <i>in
				front, opposite</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.2.6
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰστοὔμπ.
			προελθεῖν</span> Isoc.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of Time, <i>before, of old</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				277d
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				448e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔ. τούτων ῥηθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					773e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἔ</span>. our
			<i>ancestors</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				296a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hegesipp.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἔ. Χρόνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					2p.19
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Prep. c. gen., <i>before, in front of</i>,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of Place, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. αὐτῆς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς νηός</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.87
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				2.110
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of Time,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ταύτης</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γνώμης</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.144
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. εἶναι τῶν
			πραγμάτων</span> to be <i>beforehand with</i> events, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				4.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of Degree,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τοῦ δικαίου</span>
			<i>preferred before</i> justice, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				56.50
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
